title: The Red Banner
new-page: true
is-card: true
view-if: iron_front_formed == 1 and iron_front_timer = 0
on-arrival: iron_front_timer = 7; month_actions += 1; rb_militarization_cost = 2 if rb_militancy > 0.1 else rb_militarization_cost = 1; rb_militarization_cost = 3 if rb_militancy > 0.25
card-image: img/bundyell.png
frequency: 200
tags: party_affairs, antifascism

= The Red Banner

The Red Banner is our new antisolidarist coordination front, consisting of the RSDRP, the trade unions, and the SF. How should we use the Red Banner?

[? if workers_rsdrp < 45 or workers_rsdrp < workers_nts or workers_rsdrp < workers_rkp : Unfortunately, the Iron Front's effectiveness is dragged down by the RSDRP's unpopularity, as the RSDRP is no longer the dominant party among the workers. Many Reichsbanner members have left, and many workers are not interested. ?]

- @defense: Rally for defense against the fascists with the Soyuz Fevralya.
- @pacifism: Rally for pacifism, against nationalism and war.
- @republic: Rally to save the democratic republic against dictatorship.
- @wtb: Rally for economic change and the WTB-Plan.
- @antisemitism
- @easy_discard

@defense
subtitle: -[+ rb_militarization_cost +] resources
choose-if: resources >= rb_militarization_cost
on-arrival: resources -= rb_militarization_cost; rb_strength += 50; rb_militancy += 0.05; z_relation -= 5 if historical_mode

The Red Banner rallies for the militant defense of the republic against the Solidarist paramilitaries, strengthening the SF.

[? if historical_mode : The Esers decry the militarization of the Soyuz Fevralya and Red Banner, and its members are leaving the republican organization. ?]


@pacifism
on-arrival: pacifism += 1; nationalism -= 5 if pacifism >= 3; workers_rsdrp += 5*(1-dissent) if pacifism >= 4; unemployed_rsdrp += 4*(1-dissent) if pacifism >= 4; new_middle_rsdrp += 4*(1-dissent) if pacifism >= 4

The Red Banner rallies against nationalism and war.

@republic
on-arrival: pro_republic += 5*(1-dissent); democratization += 1; workers_rsdrp += 5*(1-dissent) if democratization >= 4; unemployed_rsdrp += 4*(1-dissent) if democratization >= 4; new_middle_rsdrp += 4*(1-dissent) if democratization >= 4

The Red Banner rallies in defense of the democratic republic and against dictatorship.

@wtb
choose-if: return_to_normalcy = 0
unavailable-subtitle: The economic crisis is largely over now, and the public is no longer interested in hearing about it.
view-if: wtb_adopted == 1
on-arrival: workers_rsdrp += 8*(1-dissent); unemployed_rsdrp += 8*(1-dissent); new_middle_rsdrp += 5*(1-dissent); old_middle_rsdrp += 3*(1-dissent); rural_rsdrp += 3*(1-dissent);

The WTB-Plan is the rallying point for the entire RSDRP and its affiliated organizations, including the Iron Front.

@antisemitism
title: Rally against antisemitism and in defense of Jewish Germans.
view-if: confronting_antisemitism > 1
on-arrival: nationalism -= 4*(1-dissent); pro_republic += 3*(1-dissent); confronting_antisemitism += 1; workers_nts -= 4*(1-dissent); unemployed_nts -= 4*(1-dissent);

The Solidarists and other far-right political movements are increasingly turning their hatred against the Jewish community of Russia. The People's Front rallies in defense of individual Jews and the broader community against violence.
